<#-- A screen's doc (plans/Autodoc.md). The names: the doc's header, screen, usedBy, uses and diagrams; md is
     AutodocLib.js. A site component's template/autodoc/Screen.fancy takes the place of this one. -->
<#assign md = ec.resource.script("component://framework/template/autodoc/AutodocLib.js")>
# ${md.plain(title)}

${md.nav(up, rootHref)}

- **Screen:** ${md.code(name)}
<#if screen.title>
- **Menu title:** ${md.plain(screen.title)}
</#if>
- **Render modes:** ${md.plain(screen.renderModes || "all")}<#if screen.serverStatic> · **Server static:** ${md.plain(screen.serverStatic)}</#if> · **Requires login:** ${md.plain(screen.authentication)}<#if screen.standalone> · standalone</#if><#if screen.allowExtraPath> · extra path</#if>

${description}
<#if screen.parameters.length>
## Parameters

${md.table(["Parameter", "Required", "From"], screen.parameters.map((parameter) => [md.code(parameter.name), md.yes(parameter.required), md.code(parameter.from)]))}
</#if>
<#if screen.subscreens.length>
## Subscreens

${md.table(["Item", "Menu title", "Index", "Screen"], screen.subscreens.map((item) =>
    [md.code(item.name) + (item.default ? " *(default)*" : ""), md.plain(item.title), md.plain(item.index), md.codeLink(item.location, item.href)]))}
</#if>
<#if screen.transitions.length>
## Transitions

${md.table(["Transition", "Method", "Service", "Response"], screen.transitions.map((transition) =>
    [md.code(transition.name), md.plain(transition.method), md.codeLink(transition.service, transition.serviceHref) || (transition.actions ? "actions" : ""), md.code(transition.response)]))}
</#if>
<#if screen.forms.length>
## Forms

${md.table(["Form", "Type", "Fields"], screen.forms.map((form) => [md.code(form.name), md.plain(form.type) + (form.extends ? " extends " + md.code(form.extends) : ""), md.plain(form.fields)]))}
</#if>
## Used by and uses

${md.mermaid(diagrams.usage)}

### Used by

${md.usage(usedBy)}

### Uses

${md.usage(uses)}
